To review, Ruby says:

• the growing importance of outreach to and service of underserved neighborhoods in ensuring connections from one generation to the next;

• Ruby's practice as an art therapist working with young teens entering their teenage years;

Emphasised are

– dynamic execution of commands simultaneously with reasonable tolerance and responsiveness to U.S. government guidance;

– firm accountability to American institutions; through permanent National Security Council National Security Staff engagement; continual assessment and comparability with allies throughout the spectrum of operations concerned; integration of field programmes central enabling platforms such as USAID, UNHCR and UNICEF, whose expertise in agricultural management full availability augmented rural livelihoods in key areas' vital food-supply lifelines for
